customUI.configurableSpawners.mobScale = Mob scale
customUI.configurableSpawners.mobScale.tooltip = Changes the spawned mob and preview size from 0.1x to 5.0x.
customUI.configurableSpawners.timing.tooltip = Cadence is the random delay between waves in seconds. Max alive counts only living mobs created by this block; health 0 keeps the role default.
customUI.configurableSpawners.horizontal = Horizontal spawn radius
customUI.configurableSpawners.vertical = Vertical spawn radius
customUI.configurableSpawners.maxLight = Maximum light (0-15)
customUI.configurableSpawners.space.tooltip = Horizontal radius is measured in blocks. Ground height is detected automatically; the mob can spawn when effective light is at or below the maximum.
