customUI.configurableSpawners.loot.add = Standard + custom
customUI.configurableSpawners.loot.replace = Custom replaces standard
customUI.configurableSpawners.mob.tooltip = The role list contains spawnable NPC roles. Held item is optional. Retaliating mobs become hostile only to the player who attacks them.
customUI.configurableSpawners.customArmor = Enable custom armor
customUI.configurableSpawners.armor.tooltip = Some models, such as skeletons, render armor. Others still receive its defense and properties even when it is not visible. Empty slots keep the vanilla value.
